  LYS -->|"protein-lysine methyltransferase<br/>⟨methionine (SAM), folate, vitamin B12⟩"| TML
  SAM -->|"methyl donation"| TML
  TML -->|"TML dioxygenase (TMLD)<br/>CO2+1<br/>⟨iron, vitamin C⟩"| HTML
  HTML -->|"HTML aldolase<br/>⟨vitamin B6 (PLP)⟩"| BBALD
  HTML -->|"co-product release"| GLY
  BBALD -->|"γ-butyrobetaine aldehyde dehydrogenase<br/>NADH+1<br/>⟨niacin (NAD)⟩"| BB
  BB -->|"γ-butyrobetaine dioxygenase (BBD)<br/>CO2+1<br/>⟨iron, vitamin C⟩"| CARN
